Josue	Jos	6	9	6	And they went to Josue, who then abode in the camp at Galgal, and said to him, and to all Israel with him: We are come from a far country, desiring to make peace with you. And the children of Israel answered them, and said:
Josue	Jos	6	9	7	Perhaps you dwell in the land which falls to our lot; if so, we can make no league with you.
Josue	Jos	6	9	8	But they said to Josue: We are thy servants. Josue said to them: Who are you? and whence came you?
Josue	Jos	6	9	9	They answered: From a very far country thy servants are come in the name of the Lord thy God. For we have heard the fame of his power, all the things that he did in Egypt.
