Josue	Jos	6	16	3	And goeth down westward, by the border of Jephleti, unto the borders of Beth-horon the nether, and to Gazer: and the countries of it are ended by the great sea:
Josue	Jos	6	16	4	And Manasses and Ephraim the children of Joseph possessed it.
Josue	Jos	6	16	5	And the border of the children of Ephraim was according to their kindreds: and their possession towards the east was Ataroth-addar unto Beth-horon the upper.
Josue	Jos	6	16	6	And the confines go out unto the sea: but Machmethath looketh to the north, and it goeth round the borders eastward into Thanath-selo: and passeth along on the east side to Janoe.
