Josue	Jos	6	19	38	And Jeron and Magdalel, Herem, and Bethanath and Bethsames: nineteen cities, and their villages.
Josue	Jos	6	19	39	This is the possession of the tribe of the children of Nephtali by their kindreds, the cities and their villages.
