Josue	Jos	6	19	42	Selebin and Aialon and Jethela,
Josue	Jos	6	19	43	Elon and Themna and Acron,
Josue	Jos	6	19	44	Elthece, Gebbethon and Balaath,
Josue	Jos	6	19	45	And Jud and Bane and Barach and Gethremmon:
Josue	Jos	6	19	46	And Mejarcon and Arecon, with the border that looketh towards Joppe,
Josue	Jos	6	19	47	And is terminated there. And the children of Dan went up and fought against Lesem, and took it: and they put it to the sword, and possessed it, and dwelt in it, calling the name of it Lesem Dan, by the name of Dan their father.
Josue	Jos	6	19	48	This is the possession of the tribe of the sons of Dan, by their kindreds, the cities and their villages.
