1 Kings	1Ki	9	6	15	And the Levites took down the ark of God, and the little box that was at the side of it, wherein were the vessels of gold, and they put them upon the great stone. The men also of Bethsames offered holocausts and sacrificed victims that day to the Lord.
1 Kings	1Ki	9	6	16	And the five princes of the Philistines saw, and they returned to Accaron the same day.
