2 Kings	2Ki	10	4	1	And Isboseth the son of Saul heard that Abner was slain in Hebron: and his hands were weakened, and all Israel was troubled.
2 Kings	2Ki	10	4	2	Now the son of Saul had two men captains of his bands, the name of the one was Baana, and the name of the other Rechab, the sons of Remmon a Berothite of the children of Benjamin: for Beroth also was reckoned in Benjamin.
2 Kings	2Ki	10	4	3	And the Berothites fled into Gethaim, and were sojourners there until that time.
