2 Kings	2Ki	10	10	7	And when David heard this, he sent Joab and the whole army of warriors.
2 Kings	2Ki	10	10	8	And the children of Ammon came out, and set their men in array at the entering in of the gate: but the Syrians of Soba, and of Rohob, and of Istob, and of Maacha were by themselves in the field.
